{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5594d2ff8fda790f70672613faa20e04c9b5689f9a031b7f49834771c8a9b722","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_aa171844db694e911865755d3e22d14b7f2fdc37fc474709d8c0450a7331addd"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The README describes the base agent as minimal: it lacks efficient file editing tools, devtools like tree-sitter or LSP integrations, and advanced reasoning structures, though it has building blocks to bootstrap and specialize itself.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_5df7a669d63dc6a70cfc5f0332ab5006056e72a1342a1a36665450b70d8971d1","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8dc671ce27757f461c3a19807e687a2061a4864d76f968d169d9fe3ed8d878d4","slc_b2ddd06173e834aa06fc3c1cda9d2ff0534f4dbb53901ad03ac78c73b8f4b93d"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The agent is invoked as a Python module with command-line arguments (e.g. an initial prompt via -p), and options can be listed via --help.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_75dfbcd31214c297b999891a9b0794a8636505479632f634d7d457122f776017","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=relevance","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2460071050781bca737fb5c9a6254002030e798fbc27c56f18e774848ce5ab59"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The project is associated with the SICA paper presented at the ICLR 2025 Workshop on Scaling Self-Improving Foundation Models.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a8402e0ec86b684883e4e295d728e5e5f09b84fa891b5b1398c6b81961caabf","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_249711c6d9d3083ae97dc8e167d67ffbd37e7355a7684240b866e432ed86375e","slc_fdd69ea485a4b5d859fe9677a8480c37edfe61dccb44814444b0aea251239015"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"Repository development practice: the self-improvement loop is run with python runner.py after uncommenting desired benchmarks in base_agent/src/benchmarks/__init__.py, with options like --id and --workers; results go to results/run_<id>.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a1b4b8cafb5c490d52548d6f462f7e400af747c5abd0b31327a7b52564ca71af","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d4a02471b4f4cfba96586603d4585525a3de23339bef453f63f35e147e11554"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The system runs an iterative loop: evaluate the current agent on benchmark tasks, store results in an archive, run the agent on its own codebase for an improvement, then repeat with updated code.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a930b162c6075251e66bf95cfc3c9d4dd4d0e2f11db0ea427be8068479e8e561","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=evaluation","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d4a02471b4f4cfba96586603d4585525a3de23339bef453f63f35e147e11554","slc_c8ac7f9b44c29db039e1a0e06ff8b267276a20e1c9cbcb16e1b64916b801517e"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The loop's evaluation step measures the agent's performance on benchmark tasks, and per-iteration results include per-problem results.jsonl, summary perf.jsonl metrics, and detailed traces.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_aa8476c85fd0f4f4484b2c1e518904122198b468106a0aa61259e60130c85b04","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_8dc671ce27757f461c3a19807e687a2061a4864d76f968d169d9fe3ed8d878d4"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"Running the agent with --server true exposes a web page at localhost:8080 that visualizes event-bus events and the agent callgraph, with clickable event details, overseer messages, and collapsible sub-agent traces.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_ac7a78d2a4c0314bd4621cf96e34735aabb957b8d0f7abd9b69fe580292acb6b","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d4a02471b4f4cfba96586603d4585525a3de23339bef453f63f35e147e11554","slc_c8ac7f9b44c29db039e1a0e06ff8b267276a20e1c9cbcb16e1b64916b801517e"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"Evaluation results are stored in an archive as part of the improvement loop, and each run directory keeps experiment metadata plus per-iteration agent code, benchmark results, and meta-improvement logs.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_d86919cdede9853fb5d86cbc36b744e18fb5b81cd9692d1ca9c6cf836f549787","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_d0c886bd466e7071d26203433b126eb41c996206f8b26cad5fdf413e4a792602"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The base_agent package contains modules for agents, benchmarks, callgraph, events, llm, oversight, schemas, tools, types, utils, and a web_server, plus a tests directory.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","created_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_f2b20f6880afb856b6cb2d33b42971a51eadce99f8b99cac21449ed705d5b7dd","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"maximerobeyns/self_improving_coding_agent@ed8275dca4d3 snapshot 2e3324ceb6b1bcdf","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_174e5cfc047dda5592b09cc9e0e3e110c86f87965665f378c91734893bb0019c","slc_58b09ebaf39a18bcdfabe5f3c518596e02e2abbe06b048d734999b929b4e4410"],"source_ids":["src_22a455ef95385405873699f05cafff8b"],"text":"The agent supports multiple LLM inference providers (Anthropic, OpenAI, Gemini, Vertex, Fireworks, DeepSeek); exporting a provider key makes that provider's models available, and omitting one simply disables its models.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T02:16:25Z","updated_by_operation":"op_35691776ffe64194884402395cd7c9d4"}
